>were </span><span begin="00:35.064" end="00:35.254">in </span><span begin="00:35.254" end="00:35.462">motion </span><span begin="00:35.629" end="00:35.845">but </span><span begin="00:35.845" end="00:36.053">that </span><span begin="00:36.053" end="00:36.310">went </span><span begin="00:36.310" end="00:36.902">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.214" end="00:41.046"><span begin="00:37.214" end="00:37.646">Don't </span><span begin="00:38.038" end="00:38.774">go </span><span begin="00:39.062" end="00:39.310">'cause </span><span begin="00:39.310" end="00:39.566">I </span><span begin="00:39.566" end="00:39.934">have </span><span begin="00:39.934" end="00:41.046">nobody</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.254" end="00:44.694"><span begin="00:41.254" end="00:41.479">Else </span><span begin="00:41.479" end="00:42.086">this </span><span begin="00:42.509" end="00:43.205">close </span><span begin="00:43.430" end="00:43.646">to </span><span begin="00:43.646" end="00:44.694">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.830" end="00:48.854"><span begin="00:45.830" end="00:45.982">And </span><span begin="00:45.982" end="00:46.638">you </span><span begin="00:46.998" end="00:47.798">know </span><span begin="00:48.142" end="00:48.334">I </span><span begin="00:48.334" end="00:48.598">don't </span><span begin="00:48.598" end="00:48.854">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.997" end="00:53.703"><span begin="00:48.997" end="00:49.702">Nobody </span><span begin="00:49.974" end="00:50.719">else </span><span begin="00:51.575" end="00:51.726">where </span><span begin="00:51.726" end="00:51.871">you're </span><span begin="00:51.871" end="00:52.183">supposed </span><span begin="00:52.311" end="00:52.544">to </span><span begin="00:52.544" end="00:53.703">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.038" end="00:56.890"><span begin="00:55.038" end="00:55.192">I </span><span begin="00:55.192" end="00:55.342">don't </span><span begin="00:55.342" end="00:55.583">really </span